// level for 79 of 256 values, in every textured draw (fifty-fifth session,
// tools/shadetest.py --texel). Without fast maths the program is shorter.)
// NativeRes: fragment program for textured draws without fog and without a
// separate specular colour (Final Fantasy's 2D: tile maps, sprites, clouds):
